    "title": "Save a scanner's affected users as a cohort",
    "category": "Replay vision",
    "description": "Create a static cohort of the users a scanner matched within the trailing window (default 30 days). Monitors count verdict-yes observations and take no qualifiers; classifiers require `tag`; scorers require `min_score` and/or `max_score`. The cohort is a dated snapshot and does not live-update; calling again creates a new cohort. Use it anywhere cohorts work: funnel breakdowns, retention, survey targeting, experiment exclusion. Fails when the window has no users or none resolve to a person profile.",
